  "id": "a7792a90-0e37-4798-a849-30dd1ed291da",
  "title": "Deadmanfred Oathkeeper Tank - Dungeons",
  "description": "[overview]\nThis build is mainly for random dungeon finder. Tome of Light provides an amazing uh oh button on a 5mins cd that lets your healer do dps for ~30seconds. Swap to Eternally devoted for most raid bosses or pushing mythic keys where you need 100% uptime on a specific Libram.\n\n[stats]\n(Hit/Exp) Agi > Stam > Dodge/parry > Def > Crit > Int> haste\n\n(crit gives us damage reduction due to Sacred Oath Talent)\n\n[enchants]\nFocus on Hit/Exp then Stam and Agi",
